<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 95 0 R /T(Climate change used to feel confined to journals and UN summits. That changed as its effects began showing up locally „ erratic monsoons, longer heatwaves, shrinking green cover, and waste piling up unmanaged. As a CSE student, I didn't expect my first real brush with the subject to happen outside a lab „ but Internship-1 with the Betelguese Foundation turned into exactly that.)/E(Climate change used to feel confined to journals and UN summits. That changed as its effects began showing up locally „ erratic monsoons, longer heatwaves, shrinking green cover, and waste piling up unmanaged. As a CSE student, I didn't expect my first real brush with the subject to happen outside a lab „ but Internship-1 with the Betelguese Foundation turned into exactly that.)/Pg 11 0 R /K[ 2]>>
