175 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 97 0 R /T(Most conversations about climate change happen at a scale that feels far from ordinary life „ treaties, policy, corporate targets. But the actual damage, and the actual fixing, both happen locally: a littered park, a filthy riverside, an old age home nobody visits, a hungry stray. As an engineering student trained to think in systems, this internship pushed me the other way „ toward individuals and neighbourhoods.)/E(Most conversations about climate change happen at a scale that feels far from ordinary life „ treaties, policy, corporate targets. But the actual damage, and the actual fixing, both happen locally: a littered park, a filthy riverside, an old age home nobody visits, a hungry stray. As an engineering student trained to think in systems, this internship pushed me the other way „ toward individuals and neighbourhoods.)/Pg 13 0 R /K[ 3]>>
endobj
