<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 103 0 R /T(Climate change and food insecurity are tied together more tightly than expected: erratic weather affects crop yields and prices, and the economically weaker feel it first. A family worried about its next meal isn't going to prioritise waste segregation, however good the messaging „ environmental work can't be separated from basic welfare work.)/E(Climate change and food insecurity are tied together more tightly than expected: erratic weather affects crop yields and prices, and the economically weaker feel it first. A family worried about its next meal isn't going to prioritise waste segregation, however good the messaging „ environmental work can't be separated from basic welfare work.)/Pg 19 0 R /K[ 7]>>
