597 0 obj
<</Title(Climate change used to feel confined to journals and UN summits. That changed as its effects began showing up locally „ erratic monsoons, longer heatwaves, shrinking green cover, and waste piling up unmanaged. As a CSE student, I didn't expect my first real brush with the subject to happen outside a lab „ but Internship-1 with the Betelguese Foundation turned into exactly that.)/Dest[ 11 0 R /Fit]/Parent 489 0 R /Next 598 0 R >>
endobj
598 0 obj
<</Title(I took on seven community-facing tasks „ entirely solo „ spanning cleanliness, plantation, food and cloth donation, education, elder outreach, and animal welfare. Handling every part myself shaped how deeply the experience landed.)/Dest[ 11 0 R /Fit]/Parent 489 0 R /Prev 597 0 R /First 657 0 R /Last 657 0 R /Count -1>>
endobj
